---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Resource library | Parts Relay"
  description="Find guides, parts articles and worksheets for the repair order on your desk. Search by topic, part or vehicle detail."
>
  <div class="lib-page lib-library" data-lib-list>
    <div class="lib-bound">
      <header class="lib-directory-intro">
        <h1 tabindex="-1">Resource library</h1>
        <p>
          Look up a term such as VIN, or choose a topic to find an exercise, a diagram or help with
          a question from the shop.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="lib-controls">
        <div class="lib-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Filter by topic">
          <button type="button" data-lib-filter="All" aria-pressed="true">
            All
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-lib-filter="Guides" aria-pressed="false">
            Guides
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-lib-filter="Tools" aria-pressed="false">
            Tools
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-lib-filter="Workflows" aria-pressed="false">
            Workflows
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-lib-filter="Workshops" aria-pressed="false">
            Workshops
          </button>
          <button type="button" data-lib-filter="Journal" aria-pressed="false">
            Journal
          </button>
        </div>
        <label class="lib-search">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.55"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5" />
            <path d="m16 16 5 5" />
          </svg>
          <span class="lib-visually-hidden">Search guides</span>
          <input type="search" placeholder="Search…" autocomplete="off" data-lib-search />
        </label>
      </div>
      <ul class="lib-rows" data-lib-results>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Tools">
          <a href="/tools/vin-check/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-vin">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
                <path d="M6 9v6m3-6v6m3-6v6m4-6v6m3-6v6" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>VIN format check</strong>
              <span>
                Check a VIN for length and mistyped characters before sharing it with a supplier.
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Tools</span>
              <span>Vehicle ID</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Guides">
          <a href="/guides/guidebook/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-book">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M3 5c4-1 6 0 9 2 3-2 5-3 9-2v14c-4-1-6 0-9 2-3-2-5-3-9-2zM12 7v14" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>Getting started</strong>
              <span>Take a job from a technician’s note to a message ready for your supplier.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Guides</span>
              <span>Quickstart</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Workflows">
          <a href="/repair-shops/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-shop">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M2 11 12 4l10 7M5 10v11m14-11v11M8 21v-7h8v7m-8-4h8" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>For repair shops</strong>
              <span>Decide which details from the technician’s notes belong in an enquiry.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Workflows</span>
              <span>Service desk</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Workflows">
          <a href="/distributors/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-counter">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M3 11h18v9H3zM5 7h8v4M5 17h6m5-11h4v5" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>For distributors</strong>
              <span>
                See how counter staff pick up incoming searches and follow up with a shop.
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Workflows</span>
              <span>Parts counter</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Guides">
          <a href="/tools/parts-diagrams/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-diagram">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 4zM3 12l9 4 9-4M3 17l9 4 9-4" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>Parts diagrams</strong>
              <span>Use a drawing to tell which pieces belong to the assembly.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Guides</span>
              <span>Illustrations</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Guides">
          <a href="/guides/vehicle-identification/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-vin">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
                <path d="M6 9v6m3-6v6m3-6v6m4-6v6m3-6v6" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>Vehicle identification</strong>
              <span>Troubleshoot a VIN that’s missing or returns an unexpected model.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Guides</span>
              <span>Vehicle ID</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Guides">
          <a href="/tools/part-details/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-part">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="m9 3-5 6 2 8 8 4 6-5-1-8z" />
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>Part descriptions</strong>
              <span>Compare original and aftermarket references before asking for a quote.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Guides</span>
              <span>Components</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Guides">
          <a href="/guides/counter/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-chat">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M3 4h16v11H9l-6 4zm7 14h6l5 3V9" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>At the counter</strong>
              <span>
                Work out which questions to settle before you quote a replacement headlamp.
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Guides</span>
              <span>Fit check</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Workshops">
          <a href="/workshops/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-learn">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="m2 8 10-5 10 5-10 5zm4 3v6l6 3 6-3v-6" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>Self-guided workshops</strong>
              <span>
                Pick a worksheet for the service desk, a supplier callback or the next shift.
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Workshops</span>
              <span>Worksheets</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li data-lib-item data-lib-topic="Journal">
          <a href="/journal/">
            <span class="lib-icon lib-tone-book">
              <svg
                aria-hidden="true"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.55"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M3 5c4-1 6 0 9 2 3-2 5-3 9-2v14c-4-1-6 0-9 2-3-2-5-3-9-2zM12 7v14" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-label">
              <strong>Parts Relay Journal</strong>
              <span>Field notes on brake kits, alternator labels and door mirrors.</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-row-tags">
              <span>Journal</span>
              <span>Articles</span>
            </span>
            <span class="lib-open">
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="lib-visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-lib-count></p>
      <div class="lib-empty" data-lib-empty hidden>
        <h2>No guides found</h2>
        <p>Choose All to search the whole library, or try VIN or diagrams.</p>
        <button type="button" data-lib-reset>
          Clear filters
        </button>
      </div>
      <section class="lib-desk-paths">
        <h2>Where did the enquiry stall?</h2>
        <div>
          <article>
            <h3>The record shows a different car</h3>
            <p>
              The vehicle guide covers model discrepancies and the checks to make when the catalogue
              has no result.
            </p>
            <a class="lib-inline-link" href="/guides/vehicle-identification/">
              Check the vehicle record
              <Arrow />
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Two pieces share a name</h3>
            <p>
              Open the illustrations to see where each piece sits and what you might have to buy
              with it.
            </p>
            <a class="lib-inline-link" href="/tools/parts-diagrams/">
              Compare the drawings
              <Arrow />
            </a>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>The next shift needs an answer</h3>
            <p>
              The headlamp guide covers the open fit questions to record before someone else takes
              the call.
            </p>
            <a class="lib-inline-link" href="/guides/counter/">
              Open the headlamp guide
              <Arrow />
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  import '../scripts/library.js';
</script>
